WEBVTT

00:13.110 --> 00:14.610
I don't understand.

00:15.580 --> 00:19.620
Mana, magic speed, combat skills...

00:19.620 --> 00:22.020
I'm better than you in all of them

00:22.460 --> 00:26.090
and yet I'm struggling. Why?

00:27.680 --> 00:29.550
You've got to have more fun.

00:31.330 --> 00:35.510
If I'm lacking anything...

00:36.070 --> 00:38.060
It would be actual battle experience.

00:40.770 --> 00:42.240
I knew you'd do that.

00:43.930 --> 00:45.130
Fireball!

00:47.490 --> 00:48.380
It's pointless.

00:57.410 --> 00:58.810
Strength!

01:15.810 --> 01:22.980
<i>Fate is always more heroic than any story</i>

01:25.350 --> 01:32.130
<i>The one and only despair flaunts 
a completely different sky</i>

01:32.130 --> 01:34.700
<i>A stolen smile</i>

01:34.700 --> 01:44.080
<i>Put a period on the nights 
of lament and depression</i>

01:44.080 --> 01:48.710
<i>When the season comes around 
for the second time, gear yourself up</i>

01:48.710 --> 01:53.130
<i>For the final challenge</i>

01:53.130 --> 01:56.560
<i>Why don't we struggle, cry, and bloom away?</i>

01:56.560 --> 02:02.760
<i>I have a future, a future I want to 
go back to no matter what it takes</i>

02:02.760 --> 02:06.100
<i>Here we go and embrace 
the next life, nice to meet you</i>

02:06.100 --> 02:13.150
<i>There's a world, a world 
I want to repaint with you</i>

02:13.150 --> 02:15.480
<i>Let's go see the end together</i>

02:15.480 --> 02:18.120
<i>The ending credits signal the beginning</i>

02:18.120 --> 02:22.960
<i>A special story drawn by light and shadow</i>

02:22.960 --> 02:25.290
<i>Ge ge ge ge ge get back</i>

02:25.290 --> 02:27.920
<i>To my own story</i>

02:32.260 --> 02:35.220
<b></b>Episode 9

02:32.260 --> 02:35.220
<b>  Showdown</b>

02:41.600 --> 02:43.010
You can block this, too?

02:45.180 --> 02:47.560
Did you assume I couldn't use swords?

02:55.360 --> 02:57.430
That was amazing power.

03:07.780 --> 03:08.910
<i>Why...</i>

03:11.090 --> 03:12.230
<i>Why?!</i>

03:16.220 --> 03:20.220
I'm much stronger than you are, 
so why can't I beat you?

03:30.070 --> 03:32.860
Isn't this fun, Azest?

03:34.290 --> 03:35.820
Fun?

03:36.850 --> 03:38.550
As strong as you are,

03:38.550 --> 03:41.410
you've never had a battle against 
a worthy opponent, have you?

03:43.350 --> 03:47.920
<i>Back then, you looked bored all the time</i>

03:48.380 --> 03:50.470
<i>because battles didn't challenge you..</i>

03:56.440 --> 03:58.630
Someone you can't reach 
with your magic or your sword.

03:59.080 --> 04:00.380
What do you say?

04:00.380 --> 04:04.060
Do you want to beat someone like 
that with everything you've got?

04:09.970 --> 04:13.970
I don't know about having fun, 
but I'll admit...

04:15.450 --> 04:18.200
I want to beat you.

04:19.610 --> 04:21.030
Give me everything you've got!

04:21.820 --> 04:23.060
I will.

04:32.060 --> 04:33.790
Frozen Throne!

05:00.120 --> 05:01.740
Vision Magic, huh?

05:02.540 --> 05:04.830
I can't inverse that.

05:09.250 --> 05:10.180
Are you ready?

05:36.580 --> 05:43.030
<i>Inside the frozen palace of Vision Magic, 
she can wield her magic without limitation.</i>

05:43.600 --> 05:46.720
<i>It's the trump card Azest 
used before I returned.</i>

05:47.330 --> 05:51.660
<i>It's incredible that she can use it already.</i>

05:52.310 --> 05:53.210
<i>But...</i>

06:03.030 --> 06:04.250
Are you finished?

06:10.120 --> 06:12.500
It doesn't matter how many you make.

06:16.300 --> 06:20.160
Your magic will not reach me.

06:26.130 --> 06:29.200
<i>Every spell is immediately inversed.</i>

06:30.150 --> 06:31.540
<i>What about my sword?</i>

06:32.610 --> 06:33.910
<i>No, not enough...</i>

06:35.200 --> 06:39.090
<i>Not my sword alone... nor my magic alone.</i>

07:19.260 --> 07:22.470
Brilliant, Azest.

07:40.200 --> 07:41.330
Are you okay?

07:41.330 --> 07:42.120
Yes.

07:42.990 --> 07:45.010
He is very strong.

07:47.490 --> 07:50.950
We have to beat Doneta before 
 spiky hair joins the fray.

07:52.010 --> 07:53.020
I agree.

07:59.060 --> 08:01.710
Percival, give me a hand.

08:05.820 --> 08:09.300
I thought you were going to 
take care of the commoners.

08:10.170 --> 08:13.890
I don't want to waste any more 
of my time on the stupid commoners.

08:16.270 --> 08:18.080
Talk about selfish...

08:19.570 --> 08:23.480
All right, then, let's get ready to rumble!

08:23.480 --> 08:24.580
Pram.

08:24.580 --> 08:26.010
I'll handle this.

08:28.670 --> 08:30.280
Take this!

08:38.900 --> 08:39.750
Romantica!

08:41.670 --> 08:43.170
You're dead!

08:43.800 --> 08:44.850
Crap!

08:57.540 --> 08:58.980
I can do this!

08:59.510 --> 09:00.850
Pram, get down.

09:03.490 --> 09:05.070
Checkmate!

09:26.030 --> 09:27.270
Magic sword...

09:28.180 --> 09:31.260
The ultimate attack method that can 
only be used by magic knights.

09:32.160 --> 09:35.970
Usually, it takes about 
ten years to master it, but...

09:37.210 --> 09:39.570
She fit ten years into the blink of an eye.

09:41.590 --> 09:42.590
Here I go.

09:45.610 --> 09:46.930
Stone Break!

09:56.170 --> 09:57.470
Fire Road!

10:10.610 --> 10:13.010
It seems that you can't inverse this one.

10:32.590 --> 10:34.490
It's my victory, Desi—

10:39.840 --> 10:42.630
Inversing... but what?

10:54.070 --> 10:55.200
It can't be...

11:04.130 --> 11:06.260
<i>The quest is cleared.</i>

11:06.730 --> 11:09.630
<i>The magical power of the Privius 
Clock Tower has been severed,</i>

11:09.630 --> 11:12.080
<i>and it has stopped functioning.</i>

11:12.960 --> 11:18.080
<i>This marks the end of the 
ranking tournament's final round.</i>

11:25.260 --> 11:28.560
<i>The darkness of the Privius 
Clock Tower has been dispelled.</i>

11:29.710 --> 11:33.400
<i>The clock tower will never 
again summon demons.</i>

11:35.120 --> 11:38.930
<i>The person who cleared 
the quest is... Desir Herrman.</i>

11:50.860 --> 11:52.290
Damn it!

11:55.700 --> 11:58.430
It's not possible!

11:58.430 --> 12:00.930
I will not acknowledge it!

12:10.350 --> 12:14.540
Professor Brigitte must have used 
some sort of illegal means!

12:16.500 --> 12:22.070
It's impossible for a commoner to outdo 
a magic knight and clear a Shadow World!

12:22.070 --> 12:24.120
Exactly!

12:24.120 --> 12:25.860
It's a fraud!

12:26.350 --> 12:31.060
By fraud, do you mean Professor Brigitte 
 leaked the content of the exam

12:31.060 --> 12:33.860
to certain students?

12:33.860 --> 12:36.070
That's right!

12:36.070 --> 12:37.570
Where's your proof?

12:37.570 --> 12:39.570
It's obvious!

12:40.530 --> 12:44.680
Everyone here watched them fight.

12:44.680 --> 12:47.420
It's hard to believe anything 
illegal took place.

12:47.420 --> 12:49.970
Something will turn up if we investigate!

12:52.570 --> 12:55.310
Please stop this, Professor Fergman.

12:56.110 --> 12:57.840
We're in the presence of the headmaster.

13:04.800 --> 13:05.850
Bring it to me.

13:05.850 --> 13:06.800
Yes, sir.

13:14.080 --> 13:19.060
These are the names of the single rankers 
determined by the headmaster.

13:23.030 --> 13:28.750
If you'd already determined them, 
why did you hold this meeting?

13:29.440 --> 13:32.870
I wanted to hear your opinions.

13:33.940 --> 13:38.670
Even if they are rubbish 
that isn't worth listening to.

13:38.670 --> 13:41.650
R-Rubbish?!

13:42.770 --> 13:46.720
I will read the names 
of the nine single rankers.

13:57.120 --> 13:59.400
The objective of our party

14:00.690 --> 14:03.240
was to reduce the number 
of alphas down to nine

14:03.240 --> 14:06.280
by pitting other parties against each other.

14:08.640 --> 14:12.290
But you saw right through it.

14:12.920 --> 14:19.690
Yes. You couldn't have become single 
rankers unless you defeated us...

14:19.690 --> 14:20.940
or so we thought.

14:22.530 --> 14:24.310
It wasn't just you, Azest.

14:24.310 --> 14:28.720
The other three from Blue Moon 
were focused on fighting us.

14:29.600 --> 14:33.170
That's why we were able to distract you 
from our other objective.

14:34.560 --> 14:36.530
Clearing the Shadow World?

14:37.890 --> 14:39.360
Bingo.

14:40.610 --> 14:43.070
I got to the clock tower 
slightly before you,

14:43.070 --> 14:46.720
so I tried to analyze the spell, 
but I didn't have enough time.

14:47.070 --> 14:50.550
As expected of such 
a historical magical device.

14:54.480 --> 14:57.920
I barely managed to analyze it 
because I was one-on-one with you.

14:58.820 --> 15:02.920
If all the alphas had come at me together, 
I'd have been in over my head.

15:05.800 --> 15:11.640
You weren't focused on the battle against me. 
You were looking at the bigger picture.

15:12.250 --> 15:14.740
Like I was during the entrance exam.

15:19.670 --> 15:20.910
I see.

15:26.800 --> 15:32.370
Perhaps I've been playing into
 your hands ever since.

15:37.740 --> 15:39.540
You defeated me utterly.

15:41.540 --> 15:43.050
Just by a hair.

15:43.610 --> 15:46.050
If your sword had come slightly faster...

15:46.050 --> 15:47.650
If it had,

15:50.140 --> 15:53.260
we would have fought in your place.

15:53.960 --> 15:57.010
We had already beaten Doneta 
and spiky hair.

15:58.050 --> 15:59.370
Desir!

15:59.370 --> 16:00.040
Hey.

16:00.840 --> 16:02.810
Come on, make some space.

16:05.910 --> 16:07.150
You got a problem?

16:07.150 --> 16:08.660
Grrr...

16:16.080 --> 16:20.100
We survived and won 
thanks to your magic, Romantica.

16:20.640 --> 16:21.620
Thank you.

16:21.620 --> 16:22.340
What?!

16:23.740 --> 16:26.840
Y-You don't have to thank me 
for something like that.

16:27.330 --> 16:31.080
Desir, what about me? Me?!

16:32.120 --> 16:34.680
You did really well, too, Pram.

16:34.680 --> 16:36.850
There, there, there, there!

16:38.580 --> 16:40.270
There, there, there, there!

16:39.230 --> 16:41.240
Hey! That's not fair!

16:41.240 --> 16:42.970
Thank you so much.

16:42.970 --> 16:43.950
You, too, Romantica.

16:43.950 --> 16:45.700
There, there, there, there...

16:47.650 --> 16:51.350
I mean, I didn't ask you to do that!

16:51.740 --> 16:54.340
Then you can pet my head more instead!

16:54.340 --> 16:55.460
Huh?! Why?!

17:06.450 --> 17:07.510
You're going?

17:08.190 --> 17:10.120
Professor Fergman wants to see me.

17:10.700 --> 17:12.610
Because we lost to you.

17:26.960 --> 17:27.860
Desir.

17:29.320 --> 17:34.040
I... have a favor to ask, 
although I know I'm asking a lot.

17:34.690 --> 17:35.740
What is it?

17:36.890 --> 17:41.830
Could I... join your training?

17:42.210 --> 17:43.500
What?

17:43.500 --> 17:46.310
Of course you can't!

17:46.750 --> 17:48.700
Right, Desir?

17:50.320 --> 17:55.010
Meet us at the main gate of the training area 
at six in the morning and after school.

17:55.570 --> 17:57.430
Come on, Desir!

17:59.620 --> 18:01.390
Don't nod in agreement!

18:14.320 --> 18:17.170
Well, we should get going, too.

18:18.390 --> 18:20.250
Professor Brigitte is waiting for us.

18:22.000 --> 18:25.090
Great job, everyone!

18:25.090 --> 18:26.660
Thank you.

18:27.010 --> 18:28.040
Ma'am.

18:28.900 --> 18:32.300
And... what's the verdict?

18:35.780 --> 18:37.510
First...

18:42.030 --> 18:48.290
Is that... a special cake 
from Beswald Bakery?!

18:48.990 --> 18:50.610
Is it famous?

18:51.840 --> 18:54.320
A super popular store where
 people line up for half the day

18:54.320 --> 18:55.670
just to buy a loaf of bread!

18:56.200 --> 18:59.790
Their cakes are reserved 
for the next three years!

19:00.770 --> 19:02.660
It looks yummy!

19:03.330 --> 19:06.620
If you're serving us such a 
special cake, does it mean...?

19:10.960 --> 19:12.590
No, you didn't pass.

19:12.590 --> 19:13.780
Are you kidding?!

19:14.300 --> 19:15.620
Yes, I'm kidding!

19:16.110 --> 19:17.350
What...?

19:18.430 --> 19:20.100
Jeez...

19:20.440 --> 19:23.880
I'm sorry. I wanted to surprise you.

19:25.350 --> 19:27.060
Desir Herrman.

19:27.770 --> 19:28.690
Yes.

19:29.190 --> 19:30.740
Romantica Eru.

19:30.740 --> 19:32.400
Y-Yes!

19:32.400 --> 19:34.250
Pram Schnaizer.

19:34.250 --> 19:35.240
Yes!

19:35.720 --> 19:36.980
Congratulations.

19:36.980 --> 19:42.450
As of today, all three of you are 
officially registered as single rankers.

19:42.880 --> 19:45.160
You are promoted to the alpha class.

19:47.570 --> 19:50.130
Yes!

19:50.660 --> 19:52.840
Come on, let's celebrate.

19:53.700 --> 19:55.310
Have as much as you'd like.

19:56.720 --> 19:57.970
With extra chocolate, please!

19:57.970 --> 19:59.340
With extra cream, please!

19:59.990 --> 20:02.600
Thank you so much for everything.

20:03.210 --> 20:04.760
Don't mention it.

20:04.760 --> 20:10.730
You outsmarted that dumpy scum, 
so this is the least I can do.

20:11.250 --> 20:12.940
"Dumpy scum"?

20:12.940 --> 20:14.980
Achoo!

20:19.320 --> 20:21.740
Here, enjoy!

20:36.580 --> 20:39.290
Goodbye, Ms. Brigitte!

20:49.040 --> 20:51.600
Oh, what's wrong?

20:52.730 --> 20:54.190
Teach me...

20:54.850 --> 20:57.030
Please teach me magic!

21:29.340 --> 21:33.540
<i>You've grown so strong, Desir.</i>

21:35.730 --> 21:38.480
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:38.480 --> 21:41.190
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

21:41.190 --> 21:44.800
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

21:49.280 --> 21:54.690
<i>All emotions will fade away sooner or later</i>

21:54.690 --> 21:59.290
<i>So we can pretend it's all a fairytale</i>

22:00.040 --> 22:05.410
<i>Even love is just a fleeting dream</i>

22:05.410 --> 22:09.840
<i>So let's throw the dice 
and see what's in store</i>

22:10.190 --> 22:16.360
<i>I rolled a six today, eight times in a row</i>

22:16.360 --> 22:21.620
<i>But who knows what 
tomorrow's play will bring?</i>

22:21.620 --> 22:26.650
<i>I hope one day we'll be able to say</i>

22:26.650 --> 22:30.860
<i>That not knowing was the best part</i>

22:32.370 --> 22:35.140
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:35.140 --> 22:37.830
<i>I thought you were the only one for me</i>

22:37.830 --> 22:41.340
<i>Even though that couldn't be</i>

22:43.210 --> 22:46.050
<i>If we happen to meet again in the next life</i>

22:46.050 --> 22:48.630
<i>I'll take any help I can get, 
even my own cat's</i>

22:48.630 --> 22:51.340
<i>Because this time</i>

22:51.340 --> 22:55.470
<i>I'll roll a three</i>

23:29.500 --> 23:32.970
Now, to the magical tower!

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b></b>Episode 10

23:35.480 --> 23:39.980
<b>  Respite</b>

23:36.340 --> 23:38.830
Next episode, "Respite."
